# Build context = repository root (npm workspaces: one lockfile for diskarte/ and
# early-access-portal/). Each Dockerfile COPYs only the folders its app needs.

# Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the images)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Version control, CI & editors
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
**/.DS_Store

# Environment files (never bake secrets into images)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test output, E2E specs and local tooling not needed at build time
# (unit tests stay: `next build` type-checks them)
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/.e2e-email-outbox
**/email-outbox
diskarte/e2e
diskarte/assets/brand
supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches
